          "headline": "India and EU review ties in Delhi, push for timely signing of their trade deal",
          "summary": "Senior Indian and EU officials held the 7th India-EU Strategic Partnership review in New Delhi on Monday. Sibi George of the External Affairs Ministry and the EU's Matti Maasikas discussed the timely signing and rollout of the India-EU free trade agreement, supply chains, the IMEC trade corridor and clean-energy projects.",
